SCOPE

The grant above covers the material original to this artifact: the FoRGe
harness, the Claude agent driver, the evaluation and scoring scripts, and the
assembly of the dataset.

It does not relicense third-party material redistributed here. The detection
rules in dataset/final/*.json derive from Splunk Security Content and the log
lines derive from Splunk Attack Data. Both are distributed upstream under the
Apache License 2.0:

    https://github.com/splunk/security_content
    https://github.com/splunk/attack_data

See the Attribution section of README.md. Recipients must observe the upstream
terms for that content in addition to the terms above.
